	<http://w3id.org/def/ontoreq#competencyQuestion> "What is an actuator? " ;
	<http://w3id.org/def/ontoreq#answer> "An actuator is a mechanical device for moving or controlling a mechanism or system. An actuator takes energy, usually created by air, electricity, or liquid, and converts that into some kind of motion." ;
