<http://coralcorpus.linkeddata.es/requirements#req743> a <http://w3id.org/def/ontoreq#OntologicalRequirement> ;
	<http://w3id.org/def/ontoreq#competencyQuestion> "What is a controller?" ;
	<http://w3id.org/def/ontoreq#answer> " A controller is a device that monitors inputs and controls outputs within a building automation system. A controller may be physical (having placement within a spatial structure) or logical (a software interface or aggregated within a programmable physical controller)." ;
