<http://coralcorpus.linkeddata.es/requirements#req746> a <http://w3id.org/def/ontoreq#OntologicalRequirement> ;
	<http://w3id.org/def/ontoreq#competencyQuestion> "What is a unitary control element? " ;
	<http://w3id.org/def/ontoreq#answer> "A unitary control element combines a number of control components into a single product, such as a thermostat or humidistat. A unitary control element provides a housing for an aggregation of control or electrical distribution elements that, in combination, perform a singular (unitary) purpose. Each item in the aggregation may have its own geometric representation and location." ;
	<http://coralcorpus.linkeddata.es/requirements#belongsTo> <http://coralcorpus.linkeddata.es/patterns#LSP-OP-EN> .


<http://coralcorpus.linkeddata.es/requirements#req746> <http://coralcorpus.linkeddata.es/requirements#extractedFrom> <http://coralcorpus.linkeddata.es/requirements#saref4bldg> .


