	<http://w3id.org/def/ontoreq#answer> "A protective device tripping unit breaks an electrical circuit at a separate breaking unit when a stated electric current that passes through the unit is exceeded." ;
	<http://coralcorpus.linkeddata.es/requirements#belongsTo> <http://coralcorpus.linkeddata.es/patterns#LSP-OP-EN> .


