	<http://w3id.org/def/ontoreq#competencyQuestion> "What is a damper?" ;
	<http://w3id.org/def/ontoreq#answer> " A damper typically participates in an HVAC duct distribution system and is used to control or modulate the flow of air." ;
	<http://coralcorpus.linkeddata.es/requirements#belongsTo> <http://coralcorpus.linkeddata.es/patterns#LSP-OP-EN> .


