<http://coralcorpus.linkeddata.es/requirements#req781> a <http://w3id.org/def/ontoreq#OntologicalRequirement> ;
	<http://w3id.org/def/ontoreq#competencyQuestion> "What is a duct silencer? " ;
	<http://w3id.org/def/ontoreq#answer> "A duct silencer is a device that is typically installed inside a duct distribution system for the purpose of reducing the noise levels from air movement, fan noise, etc. in the adjacent space or downstream of the duct silencer device." ;
	<http://coralcorpus.linkeddata.es/requirements#belongsTo> <http://w3id.org/resource/ontoreq#LSP-OP-EN> .


